WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.493
The Page, Knight, Queen and King of Wands bring
the energy of fire to a tarot spread.

00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:11.475
Court cards can be people, parts of yourself
or ways of approaching a situation.

00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:13.702
Page of Wands.

00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:15.888
Curiosity, enthusiasm, new ideas.

00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:21.517
The Page stands in a desert landscape and looks
closely at the wand held in one hand.

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:23.814
Knight of Wands.

00:00:23.814 --> 00:00:25.435
Passion, speed, adventure.

00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:30.422
The Knight rides a rearing horse, armour
covered with a pattern, wand held high.

00:00:31.822 --> 00:00:34.157
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:34.157 --> 00:00:38.892
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
